  "title": "OpenBMI SSVEP EEG dataset (Lee et al. 2019)",
  "description": "This derivative dataset contains preprocessed steady-state visually evoked potential (SSVEP) EEG recordings from the OpenBMI study. The dataset comprises EEG data collected during SSVEP-based brain-computer interface experiments, organized according to the Brain Imaging Data Structure (BIDS) standard. This resource facilitates benchmarking and development of BCI algorithms through standardized, openly accessible neurophysiological data.",
